; Sprout Gym - bouncy garden stroll in G major with a lydian lift. Original composition, CC0-1.0.
#title Garden Maze
#tempo 112
#time 4/4
#key G major, G lydian
#inst 1 duty=1 env=11,-3 rel=-1 vib=24,10,5
#inst 2 duty=2 env=8,-3 rel=-1
#inst 3 wave=0 env=14,0
#def Ma o4 r8 c8 e8 g8 r8 c8 e8 g8
#def Mi o4 r8 c8 d+8 g8 r8 c8 d+8 g8
#def Bs o2 c4 c8 r8 g4 g8 r8
#def dr K8 H8 S8 H8 K8 H8 S8 H16 H16
#def ma g8 a8 b8 g8 > d4 < b4 | a8 f+8 a8 > d8 < a4 f+4 | b8 g8 e8 g8 b4 > e4 < | e8 g8 e8 c8 d2 | g8 a8 b8 > d8 e4 d4 < | > c8 < b8 a8 b8 > c4 d4 < | e8 a8 > c8 e8 d4 c4 < | c+8 e8 a8 e8 c+4 e4 |
#def mb > d4. d8 < b4 g4 | f+8 b8 > d8 f+8 < b4 f+4 | e8 g8 > c8 e8 d4 c4 < | > d8 c8 < b8 a8 > d2 < | e8 g8 b8 g8 b4. g8 | g8 e8 c8 e8 g4 e4 | a4 e4 a4 > c4 < | > d4 c4 < b4 a4 |

A @1 o5 $ {ma} {mb}
B @2 $ k7{Ma} | k2{Ma} | k4{Mi} | k0{Ma} | k7{Ma} | k2{Ma} | k9{Mi} | k9{Ma} | k7{Ma} | k-1{Mi} | k0{Ma} | k2{Ma} | k4{Mi} | k0{Ma} | k9{Mi} | k2{Ma} | k0
C @3 $ k7{Bs} | k2{Bs} | k4{Bs} | k0{Bs} | k7{Bs} | k2{Bs} | k9{Bs} | k9{Bs} | k7{Bs} | k11{Bs} | k0{Bs} | k2{Bs} | k4{Bs} | k0{Bs} | k9{Bs} | k2{Bs} | k0
D v9 $ [{dr}]16
